1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,640
Wealth. Fame. Power.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,577
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,197
attained this and everything
else the world had to offer,

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:10,456
and his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,955
You want my treasure?

6
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,420
You can have it.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,600
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

8
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,060
Now you just have to find it.

9
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:24,237
These words lured men to
the Grand Line in pursuit

10
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,757
of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine.

11
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,517
This is the time known
as the Great Pirate Era.

12
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,120
Come aboard and bring along
all your hopes and dreams.

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:40,440
Together we will find everything
that we're looking for.

14
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,700
One piece.

15
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:52,697
Compass left behind,
it'll only slow us down.

16
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:58,457
Your heart will be your guide,
raise the sails and take the helm.

17
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:01,137
That legendary place.

18
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:03,897
That the end of the map reveals.

19
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:06,657
Is only legendary.

20
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:10,117
Until someone proves it real.

21
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,557
Through it all?

22
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,497
Through all the trouble and times.

23
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,817
Through the heartache
and through the pain.

24
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:21,380
Know that I will be there to stand by you.

25
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:24,200
Just like I know you'll stand by me.

26
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:30,417
So come aboard and bring along
all your hopes and dreams.

27
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:35,877
Together we will find everything
that we're looking for.

28
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:42,440
There's always room for you
if you want to be my friend.

29
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,597
We are.

30
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,857
We are.

31
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:46,797
On the cruise.

32
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,700
We are.

33
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,777
Don't call it murder, Jango.

34
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:55,877
I don't like the sound of it.

35
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,737
Oh, right, accident.

36
00:01:57,820 --> 00:02:00,240
It's an accident that you planned.

37
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:04,040
Uh, what are those guys talking about?

38
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:05,457
Just be quiet.

39
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:08,077
Maybe if we listen a little
closer, we can find out?

40
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,057
We can't simply kill her.

41
00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:14,637
It is critical to our plan that Miss
Kaya perishes in an unfortunate accident!

42
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,660
So don't screw that up.

43
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,500
So basically, on your signal,

44
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,277
the men and I stormed
the village and managed

45
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,831
to accidentally kill the little rich girl.

46
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:27,557
Then you get her inheritance
and we all get paid, right?

47
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,480
You moron!

48
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,346
Your ignorance is astounding.

49
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:33,877
We're not related, so how could
I inherit anything from her?

50
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,460
You'll work very hard to.

51
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,860
No, Jango, I won't.

52
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,300
Now listen to me.

53
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,317
This is the most important part.

54
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:45,257
Before you kill her, you'll use your
hypnosis to make Kaya write her will.

55
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:50,200
and it will say I leave my entire
fortune to my butler, Klahadore.

56
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:55,757
Then and only then will I
have undisputed control of

57
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:59,820
her enormous fortune and no
one will suspect a thing.

58
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:05,857
I have spent three long years gaining
the trust of everyone around me so that

59
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:10,646
it would be unsurprising for her to leave
the entirety of her inheritance to me.

60
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:13,820
Three years as a butler for this, huh?

61
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:15,990
Huh?

62
00:03:16,073 --> 00:03:18,400
You sure had us scared
back then, Captain Kuro.

63
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:23,316
Three years ago, you suddenly said
you were giving up life as a pirate.

64
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:26,977
In no time at all, you set
up someone to be your double.

65
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:30,460
Then you let the world see
Captain Kuro get executed.

66
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:44,677
Only now do I understand that was
just the beginning of this plan.

67
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,137
You are the man of a thousand plans!

68
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,920
Never call me that again.

69
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:51,597
I abandoned that name years ago.

70
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:55,777
I now wish to obtain my wealth without
attracting the attention of the government.

71
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:58,480
In other words, I'm a pacifist.

72
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,220
The pacifist you are.

73
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:07,320
Murdering an entire family doesn't
exactly qualify as peaceful.

74
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:11,117
Hold on, I haven't
murdered an entire family.

75
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,357
The father's death wasn't planned.

76
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,837
Whatever you say, it
makes no difference to me.

77
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:18,937
If it's all the same to you,
hurry up and give the word.

78
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:20,637
The crew is getting bored.

79
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:23,977
We've been waiting in the waters
near here for over a week.

80
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:27,060
And the men are growing
more anxious by the minute.

81
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,397
This is horrible.

82
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,780
This is really horrible!

83
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,297
What are they talking about?

84
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,717
Is it bad guy stuff?

85
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:45,117
What weren't you listening to any of that?

86
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,597
Those guys aren't just bad.

87
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,510
They're evil.

88
00:04:47,593 --> 00:04:51,597
Captain Kaido is known to be the
most devious skimming pirate around.

89
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:55,697
And though he's known for his smarts,
he's legendary for his brutality.

90
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:59,597
Word had it that the Marines caught
and executed him three years ago.

91
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:04,180
But Captain Kuro is alive and
well, posing as Clawdor the butler.

92
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:09,224
And he's had his diabolical sights set on
Kaya's fortune for the last three years.

93
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:16,020
First they'll attack the
village, then they'll kill Kaya!

94
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,360
This is bad!

95
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,400
This is seriously bad!

96
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,840
Hey, get down! I'll see you!

97
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,300
