A pity, really.

132
00:06:49,013 --> 00:06:50,237
I didn't mean to kill him.

133
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:52,791
But there's no way he could have survived.

134
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,420
This can't be happening.

135
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,580
