225
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:56,900
Your loyalty will be richly rewarded.

226
00:11:57,580 --> 00:12:01,109
I intend on being more than
generous when I divide the take.

227
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:07,220
At dawn tomorrow, destroy the village to
your heart's content. Oh, no! Kill him!

228
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:08,510
Kill him!

229
