233
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,915
No question about it.

234
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,837
So what made you think
it'd be a good time for

235
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:32,417
a nap that's the thing i
don't remember going to

236
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:35,697
sleep or getting down
here at all this proves

237
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:38,637
that clawador is a bad guy
Usopp saw right through

238
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:41,377
him I bet he's on his way
to warn the villagers so

239
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:43,977
they'll have time to run
away well that's perfect

240
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:46,277
Those stupid pirates
won't hurt anyone because

241
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:48,677
the town will be abandoned
by the time they get

242
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,878
Yeah, that's right.

243
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:52,097
We'd better run away,
too, if we want to live.

244
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:55,533
All right, let's pack our
treasure and run like the wind!

245
